{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for and grab object, check it, move to object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToFindObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectCheckTask    />\"",
